      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The appearance of a Matcap can vary significantly depending on the shader.\n\nThe first image uses VRC Toon Standard, the second uses VRC Matcap Lit, and the third uses Liltoon.\n\nIdeally, it would be best if VRC Toon Standard could use the features of VRC Matcap Lit,\n\nbut VRC Matcap Lit does not support Normal Maps.\n\nOh, I almost forgot — the fourth image is the texture used for the Matcap.",
